six months earlier, we were all there.

2085
01:24:09.360 --> 01:24:13.710
And my sister was with me and we all went to go see KATU,

2086
01:24:13.710 --> 01:24:14.940
I forget his last name,

2087
01:24:14.940 --> 01:24:17.250
but one of the holy men that she consulted

2088
01:24:17.250 --> 01:24:20.823
that's in Epray love.

2089
01:24:21.870 --> 01:24:25.200
And so she went to see him and then she took me to see him.

2090
01:24:25.200 --> 01:24:26.670
And he did his whole thing

2091
01:24:26.670 --> 01:24:29.070
where he's kind of tells your fortune.

2092
01:24:29.070 --> 01:24:32.010
He predicted the success of you pray love by the way.

2093
01:24:32.010 --> 01:24:37.010
And he looks at me

2094
01:24:38.321 --> 01:24:41.887
and he says, I forget exactly what went down, but he said,

